      "Differentiation": "• Strong differentiation potential – the heirloom-quality provenance concept is unique. The machine-readable registry of ethical standards is a particularly interesting idea.",
      "Impact and Evidence Plan": "• Lacks concrete evidence of impact. The ‘community-run witness network’ is vague and untested.  Needs a plan for measuring and reporting on the actual impact of verified provenance.",
