    "Project B": {
      "Clarity of Value Proposition": "• Very clear and straightforward. The concept of sponsoring a hive and receiving honey is easy to understand and appealing.",
      "Market Size and Demand": "• Large and accessible market – eco-conscious consumers, families, and businesses are actively seeking sustainable options.",
      "Feasibility and Development Plan": "• More realistic and phased development plan. The MVP approach is sensible, and the roadmap is well-defined.",
      "Revenue Model and Sustainability": "• Simple and reliable revenue model – direct sales of honey and sponsorship packages.",
